d semantics (§6.2.3/§11), failure protocol judgment (§7.1-7.4), scope management (§9.4-9.5), fidelity-sensitive judgment (§10.4), prompt design (§12.6), and various guidance rules.\n\n### Bottom Line\n\n**~15 rules are ALREADY hook-enforced** (git blocking/gating, orchestrator write block, comment discipline, lifecycle watcher).\n\n**~13 rules are HIGH/MEDIUM priority hookable gaps** that could be closed with trivial code additions to existing plugins or crosslink CLI fork.\n\n**~30 rules are NOT hookable** — they require human judgment, model reasoning, or semantic understanding that cannot be mechanically enforced.","created_at":"2026-08-18T05:37:35.103383317Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:njvpjC/AQsDrHvQwnEDxNIVk/N2/Mh23XsRXGm8vok0","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgSEz/PK87LwUBCX4j0Yx6Mk62/dEtcYm0oQqrFvVHFnMAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA/H2nozob6yexBLuBt3xfzs85mBJB8NMJvk8X3yTpQ9Mu22YHKWiLqUxdNWkhUyom0n9pHKOMrwhPuy4Hru4tAw=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:njvpjC/AQsDrHvQwnEDxNIVk/N2/Mh23XsRXGm8vok0","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgSEz/PK87LwUBCX4j0Yx6Mk62/dEtcYm0oQqrFvVHFnMAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGjKojIiJ88VidB8IuL1unwXGavIVnSgGAZ2ntopvvXdRrYJvyPG45ICWF4N3os0LX/L+KO+ho9PcO1W1OX0YwE="}
